#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Information about IBM Quantum on IBM Cloud logging"
msgstr "Informations sur la journalisation d'IBM Quantum sur IBM Cloud"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Logging for IBM Quantum Compute Service"
msgstr "Logging pour IBM Quantum Compute Service"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Logging for IBM Quantum Compute Service {#logging-for-ibm-quantum-compute-service}"
msgstr "Logging pour IBM Quantum Compute Service {#logging-for-ibm-quantum-compute-service}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Cloud&reg; services, such as IBM Quantum Compute Service, generate platform logs that you can use to investigate abnormal activity and critical actions in your account, and troubleshoot problems.\n"
msgstr "Les services IBM Cloud&reg;, tels qu'IBM Quantum Compute Service, génèrent des journaux de plateforme que tu peux utiliser pour examiner les activités anormales et les actions critiques dans ton compte, ainsi que pour résoudre des problèmes.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use [IBM Cloud Logs Routing](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-router?topic=logs-router-about), which is a platform service, to route platform logs in your account to a destination of your choice by configuring a tenant that defines where platform logs are sent. For more information, see [About Logs Routing](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-router?topic=logs-router-about).\n"
msgstr "Tu peux utiliser [IBM Cloud Logs Routing,](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-router?topic=logs-router-about) un service de plateforme, pour acheminer les journaux de plateforme de ton compte vers la destination de ton choix en configurant un tenant qui définit l'endroit où les journaux de plateforme sont envoyés. Pour plus d'informations, consulte [À propos de Logs Routing.](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-router?topic=logs-router-about)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use [IBM Cloud Logs](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-logs) to visualize and alert on platform logs that are generated in your account and routed by IBM Cloud Logs Routing to an IBM Cloud Logs instance.\n"
msgstr "Tu peux utiliser [IBM Cloud Logs](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-logs) pour visualiser et recevoir des alertes sur les journaux de plateforme générés dans ton compte et acheminés par IBM Cloud Logs Routing vers une instance IBM Cloud Logs.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Locations where platform logs are generated {#locations-where-platform-logs-are-generated}"
msgstr "Emplacements où les journaux de plateforme sont générés {#locations-where-platform-logs-are-generated}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Cloud Container Registry generates platform logs that are displayed in your logging instances. The following table lists the locations where the automatic collection of Container Registry service logs is enabled.\n"
msgstr "IBM Cloud Container Registry génère des journaux de plateforme qui s'affichent dans tes instances de journalisation. Le tableau suivant liste les emplacements où la collecte automatique des journaux du service Container Registry est activée.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Location                   | Are platform services logs available? |\n"
"|----------------------------|---------------------------------------|\n"
"| Washington, D.C. (us-east) |                  Yes                  |\n"
"| Frankfurt (eu-de)          |                  Yes                  |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Emplacement                | Journaux des services de plateforme disponibles ? |\n"
"|----------------------------|---------------------------------------------------|\n"
"| Washington, D.C. (us-east) |                       Oui                        |\n"
"| Francfort (eu-de)          |                       Oui                        |\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Platform logs that are generated {#platform-logs-that-are-generated}"
msgstr "Journaux de plateforme générés {#platform-logs-that-are-generated}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Quantum Compute Service generates platform services logs that are displayed in your logging instances for the following specific cases:\n"
msgstr "IBM Quantum Compute Service génère des journaux de services de plateforme qui s'affichent dans tes instances de journalisation dans les cas spécifiques suivants :\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "When the state of a job changes.\n"
msgstr "Lorsque l'état d'un job change.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Viewing logs from the Observability page {#viewing-logs-from-the-observability-page}"
msgstr "Afficher les journaux depuis la page Observabilité {#viewing-logs-from-the-observability-page}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For information about launching the IBM Cloud Logs interface, see **Launching the UI** in the [IBM Cloud Logs documentation](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-logs?topic=cloud-logs-instance-launch).\n"
msgstr "Pour en savoir plus sur le lancement de l'interface IBM Cloud Logs, consulte **Launching the UI** dans la [documentation IBM Cloud Logs.](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/cloud-logs?topic=cloud-logs-instance-launch)\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fields by log type {#fields-by-log-type}"
msgstr "Champs par type de journal {#fields-by-log-type}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For information about fields included in every platform log, see [Fields that are included in platform logs](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-router?topic=logs-router-about-platform-logs#about-platform-logs-2).\n"
msgstr "Pour en savoir plus sur les champs inclus dans chaque journal de plateforme, consulte [Fields that are included in platform logs.](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/logs-router?topic=logs-router-about-platform-logs#about-platform-logs-2)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following fields are included in the log record.\n"
msgstr "Les champs suivants sont inclus dans l'enregistrement de journal.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Field           | Type     | Description                                                              |\n"
"|-----------------|----------|--------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n"
"| logSourceCRN    | Required | Defines the account and flow log instance where the log is published.    |\n"
"| saveServiceCopy | Required | Defines whether IBM saves a copy of the record for operational purposes. |\n"
"| message         | Required | Description of the log that is generated.                                |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Champ           | Type      | Description                                                                              |\n"
"|-----------------|-----------|------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n"
"| logSourceCRN    | Obligatoire | Définit le compte et l'instance de journal de flux où le journal est publié.            |\n"
"| saveServiceCopy | Obligatoire | Définit si IBM conserve une copie de l'enregistrement à des fins opérationnelles.       |\n"
"| message         | Obligatoire | Description du journal généré.                                                           |\n"
